    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the medical side, but it doesn't feel like a \"symptom\" or anything bad. it feels like my brain is just finally tuning into frequencies that were always there, but i was just too \"blind\" to see them before. like, if i can see the thermal energy of a living thing, that's not just a migraine, right? it feels like my nervous system is upgrading to handle a more complex layer of reality. if this is a biological shift, how would one even start to stabilize it so it doesn't become overwhelming?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
